    "note": "Mycroft patent intelligence progress video 9. Real session: built a React (Vite) frontend calling the FastAPI backend from video 8, built against the real response shape for both classify=false and classify=true. Found a real bug along the way: a .env file with the Anthropic key existed but was never loaded (no python-dotenv, no load_dotenv() call) -- every session relied on manually exporting the key, which silently broke whenever the terminal tab closed. Fixed by adding python-dotenv + load_dotenv(). Also reorganized the Patents-Intelligence-Engine repo folder: loose chapter folders into chapters/, claims_agent/ renamed to patent-reader/ with backend/frontend split.",
